## Scope of this licence

This MIT licence covers the **source code** of this repository: everything
under `src/` (application, engine and view code), `scripts/`, configuration
files, and the build tooling — except the encoded party/rule *data* described
below.

It does **not** cover:

- The method text and documentation (`METHODOLOGY.md`, `docs/`, `PROJECT.md`,
  `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`, `CORRECTIONS.md`) or the encoded numbers in
  `src/data/` (party rules, baseline/adopted rules, provenance, worksheets
  referenced from code). Those are licensed **CC BY 4.0** — see
  [`LICENSE-DATA.md`](./LICENSE-DATA.md).
- Third-party source material under `sources/` (raw PDFs/HTML/JSON, their
  text extracts, and the reconciliation worksheets derived from them). Those
  files remain under their original owners' terms and are **not** licensed by
  this project at all — see [`docs/rights.md`](./docs/rights.md).
